# request: "Architecture of our support assistant for the AI platform docs.
#  Support agents ask questions in Slack; the Assistant API (FastAPI) keeps the
#  chat history in Redis, sends prompts to Claude and runs its tool calls:
#  ticket lookup, order status and issue refund. It also queries a hybrid
#  retriever that searches the top 8 chunks in a pgvector index. A nightly
#  Airflow job chunks and embeds the Zendesk help center articles and upserts
#  them into the index. Highlight the Assistant API."
type: llm-app
reader: engineers reading the AI platform docs
width: 800
direction: down
focus: app
out: evals, guardrails, observability, auth, the Slack bot plumbing
nodes:
  user: Support agent\nSlack
  app: Assistant API\nFastAPI
  llm: LLM\nClaude API {external}
  tools: Tools
  tools.tickets: Ticket lookup
  tools.orders: Order status
  tools.refunds: Issue refund
  memory: Chat history\nRedis {shape: cylinder}
  retriever: Retriever\nhybrid search
  index: Nightly indexing
  index.docs: Help center\nZendesk {external}
  index.embed: Embed job\nAirflow
  vectors: Vector index\npgvector {shape: cylinder}
edges:
  user <-> app: question / answer
  app <-> llm: prompt / reply
  app <-> tools: call / result
  app <-> memory: history
  app <-> retriever: query / chunks
  retriever <-> vectors: search / top-8
  index.docs -> index.embed: articles
  index.embed -> vectors: upsert {dashed}
